menu "Fingerprint sensor drivers"

config SENSORS_VFS7XXX
	tristate "Validity/Synaptics VFS7XXX fingerprint sensor"
	depends on SPI
	help
	  Say Y here to enable support for the Validity/Synaptics VFS7XXX
	  fingerprint sensor, connected over SPI. Provides a /dev/vfsspi
	  character device with raw SPI transfer and DRDY-signal ioctls for
	  a userspace matching daemon.

endmenu
